{"detail": {"templateUuid": "100bafcc2cb74a1ebc8c99226e98b6e0", "projectUuid": "2d47b4b90116483fbad7ac34faab93a4", "name": "QLT x AI 行李箱", "description": "这不仅是一次视觉的震撼，更是对传统行李箱防护极限的彻底颠覆！本片采用极其暴力的视觉语言，将 QLT x AI 智能硬核行李箱 置于大自然的极端极境之中。\n\n从高空坠落的重击、悬崖翻滚的摩擦，到深水浸泡的侵蚀与极寒冰封的严酷考验，QLT x AI 凭借地表最强的抗冲击外壳、顶级的全密封防水性，交出了令人惊叹的完美答卷。\n\n视频通过节奏感极强的剪辑与充满力量感的音效，完美诠释了“WHAT GOES HERE GOES ANYWHERE”的产品理念——无论你的下一站是无人区越野、极端气象科考，还是跨国商务穿梭，装进 QLT x AI，你的行李便无所畏惧。它是科技发烧友、全地形探险及极限旅行者不容错过的终极机能装备！", "coverUrl": "/assets/4fe7e83324d02e9f.webp", "finalOutput": "https://libtv-res.liblib.art/upload-images/7a936396e1d940aa8e0460a8d5f459f3/b2fd39eb56e548c9cb43b345c3f9dff7d7f9c4af.mp4", "snapshotId": 19029, "auditStatus": 1, "ownerId": 976456, "ownerUuid": "7a936396e1d940aa8e0460a8d5f459f3", "avatar": "https://thirdwx.qlogo.cn/mmopen/vi_32/Q0j4TwGTfTIyNIia6IFvSwg6fgEhKtHU4EjdoibDP9hRcuxwNmUymeZViciaZBFlj6eqiaCibRukrkTPPwB5gxvN0DJg/132", "nickname": "清凉兔", "isLike": false, "likeCount": 136, "tags": [{"id": 3040, "code": "test", "tagLabel": "广告导演请就位", "parentTag": 0, "categoryId": 0, "path": "3040/", "tagStatus": 1, "tagOrder": 10, "tagIcon": "", "children": null, "tagType": 5}, {"id": 3041, "code": "test", "tagLabel": "1-创意TVC", "parentTag": 3040, "categoryId": 0, "path": "3040/3041", "tagStatus": 1, "tagOrder": 10, "tagIcon": "", "children": null, "tagType": 5}, {"id": 1101, "code": "product_show", "tagLabel": "产品展示", "parentTag": 1100, "categoryId": 0, "path": "1100/1101/", "tagStatus": 1, "tagOrder": 1, "tagIcon": "", "children": null, "tagType": 1}, {"id": 1104, "code": "creative_tvc", "tagLabel": "创意TVC", "parentTag": 1100, "categoryId": 0, "path": "1100/1104/", "tagStatus": 1, "tagOrder": 4, "tagIcon": "", "children": null, "tagType": 1}, {"id": 1102, "code": "feature_selling", "tagLabel": "功能卖点", "parentTag": 1100, "categoryId": 0, "path": "1100/1102/", "tagStatus": 1, "tagOrder": 2, "tagIcon": "", "children": null, "tagType": 1}, {"id": 1000, "code": "selected", "tagLabel": "精选画布", "parentTag": 0, "c